sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a<br>Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): State is Authorized AND<br>EVConnectedPreSession AND<br>ISO15118SmartCharging

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Trigger SetChargingProfile<br>- evseId <Configured evseId><br>- chargingProfilePurpose TxProfile<br>- transactionId <Provided transactionId from before>

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, chargingProfilePurpose = TxProfile, transactionId = <Provided transactionId from before>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation (Step 1): SetChargingProfileRequest<br>- evseId <Configured evseId><br>- chargingProfilePurpose TxProfile<br>- transactionId <Provided transactionId from before>

    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, maxScheduleTuples & chargingNeeds = <Configured values from mock EV>)

    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse (status = Accepted or Processing)
    Note over CSMS: Validation (Step 4): NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse<br>- status Accepted or Processing

    opt NotifyEVChargingNeedsResponse status was Processing
        Note over CS: Test System will wait 60 seconds for the SetChargingProfileRequest
    end

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, chargingProfilePurpose = TxProfile, transactionId = <Provided transactionId from before>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation (Step 5): SetChargingProfileRequest<br>- evseId <Configured evseId><br>- chargingProfilePurpose TxProfile<br>- transactionId <Provided transactionId from before>

    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, chargingSchedule = <ChargingSchedule provided at step 3>)

    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEVChargingScheduleResponse (status = Accepted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation (Step 8): NotifyEVChargingScheduleResponse<br>- status Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
